# Concept: Golden issue

> **Status governs editing:**
> While `Status: Draft`: the assigned agent may fill Objective, Detail (only
> when Source is `interactive`), Requirements, and Scope & Boundaries — by
> replacing the `<!-- Agent: ... -->` placeholders. Every proposed value must
> be approved by the Orchestrator via the question tool before it is written.
> Never touch anything above the `---` frontmatter delimiter: the CLI owns
> `Status`, `Locked-At`, and `Lock-Hash`.
> Once `Status: Locked` (set by `orbit neocortex issue lock`): this file is
> IMMUTABLE. If requirements change mid-run, record it via
> `orbit neocortex addenda new` — never edit this file.

